/// backup, it must be in a 'READY' state and you must own it. While you can
/// share a backup using the CloudHSM PutResourcePolicy operation, we
/// recommend using Resource Access Manager (RAM) instead. Using RAM
/// provides multiple benefits as it creates the policy for you, allows
/// multiple resources to be shared at one time, and increases the
